      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. Importance of Mountains in India"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bqs5nx4",
      "content": "• Mountains act as natural barriers and protect the country."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "c5p2dca",
      "content": "• They influence the climate and monsoon rainfall."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5rnfkbd",
      "content": "• They are the source of major rivers."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bdzpqfj",
      "content": "• They provide forests, biodiversity and natural resources."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1gzwrao",
      "content": "• They support tourism and hill stations."
    },
